--- kv_hashmap -- in-memory HashMap-backed KeyValueStore implementation.
---
--- This is an impl crate: the HashKeyValueStore implements the
--- KeyValueStore trait from plugin-lib-kv. The kv.* ops are declared
--- here and bound to Rust handls that delegate to HashKeyValueStore.
--- kv.get        -- get a value by key (String? — null when absent).
--- kv.set        -- set a key/value pair.
--- kv.remove     -- remove a key.
--- kv.clear      -- remove all entries.
--- kv.has        -- test key membership.
--- kv.size       -- number of entries.
---
--- Atom spec: `atoms.yaml` (P-013/T-151) — the `kv.*` dispatch keys,
--- signatures, and impl bindings (`kv_impls()` in src/lib.rs) live
--- there now; the cap/op/handle decl lines were stripped.
